---

= Instructions

Rub the rim of the #Cocktail glass{} with a @Lime wedge{} or @Water{} to wet it.
Dip the rim into a shallow container filled with @Tajin{}. Set aside.

Add @Passion fruit puree or pulp{1 oz}, @Tequila{2 oz}, @Orange liqueur{1 oz}, freshly squeezed @Lime juice{1 oz}, 
and @Simple syrup{3/4 oz} to a #Cocktail shaker{} with @Ice{}. Shake well until chilled through, about ~{15 seconds}.

Fill rimmed cocktail glass with @Ice{}.

Strain margarita into the prepared cocktail glass. Garnish with a fresh @Lime wheel{}.